{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Ice Cream Shop Simulator Demo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo version lets you experience the core of the game in advance. Open a small ice cream shop, prepare cones using a selection of available recipes, and serve a limited number of customers by the seaside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025050/extras/fb76f7cdd6b88175508c2d74a963ce4c.poster.avif?t=1758476543\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025050/extras/fb76f7cdd6b88175508c2d74a963ce4c.webm?t=1758476543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taste the core gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders, measure ingredients, churn the ice cream, and complete the cones as quickly as possible. Even in this reduced version, you can enjoy the chaotic experience of running your own shop and, if you wish, try it out in online co-op mode.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025050/extras/79a5ece153de6571392ed06d7f78aeda.poster.avif?t=1758476543\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025050/extras/79a5ece153de6571392ed06d7f78aeda.webm?t=1758476543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A glimpse of the full game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many features are limited compared to the final version: fewer recipes, fewer decorations, and less customer variety. This demo is designed to give you a first taste of the atmosphere and core mechanics that will be fully expanded in the complete game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Ice Cream Shop Simulator to your wishlist so you don\u2019t miss the release of the Early Access.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025050?t=1758476543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025050/d80e0a8a1bada52727d4ca355d8c66fe8bfca08b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758476543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025050/84596f9543b567fdbd234416ca757bf24a91cb43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758476543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025050/84596f9543b567fdbd234416ca757bf24a91cb43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758476543","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Ice Cream Shop Simulator Demo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo version lets you experience the core of the game in advance. Open a small ice cream shop, prepare cones using a selection of available recipes, and serve a limited number of customers by the seaside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025050/extras/fb76f7cdd6b88175508c2d74a963ce4c.poster.avif?t=1758476543\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025050/extras/fb76f7cdd6b88175508c2d74a963ce4c.webm?t=1758476543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taste the core gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders, measure ingredients, churn the ice cream, and complete the cones as quickly as possible. Even in this reduced version, you can enjoy the chaotic experience of running your own shop and, if you wish, try it out in online co-op mode.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025050/extras/79a5ece153de6571392ed06d7f78aeda.poster.avif?t=1758476543\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025050/extras/79a5ece153de6571392ed06d7f78aeda.webm?t=1758476543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A glimpse of the full game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many features are limited compared to the final version: fewer recipes, fewer decorations, and less customer variety. This demo is designed to give you a first taste of the atmosphere and core mechanics that will be fully expanded in the complete game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Ice Cream Shop Simulator to your wishlist so you don\u2019t miss the release of the Early Access.</p>","developers":["Nexars Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3650330","name":"Ice Cream Shop Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025050/96aaf96d1d06449a6f7a25dcdc9e88c332f383c3/header.jpg?t=1758476543","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4025050/2122152734/23dd23fa1f9ceb770c051d79c4d1872b6b4ea7bf/1757583431/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758476541","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4025050/2122152734/23dd23fa1f9ceb770c051d79c4d1872b6b4ea7bf/1757583431/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758476541","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steams